BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_bec8f889-cb7d-3f89-b202-b210c324c37e.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
